  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/976593245838651472/1156623864030310491/Urban_Warfare_slab.png?ex=6515a56a&is=651453ea&hm=280b157251cbe3a78b76672cc4147b027dcd203a72112b0a0aad3e4b80d8e7aa&\" alt=\"Urban Warfare 模組\" width=\"1903\" height=\"496\"></p>\n<p><span><strong>重要提示：</strong>該模組並未停止開發，請期待近期更新！<br></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>Urban Warfare</strong> 是一個全新模組，為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mrcrayfishs-gun-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrCrayfish's Gun Mod</a> 增添了更多內容，<strong>目前</strong>已為基礎模組新增了 6 種槍枝，未來還計劃加入更多。</span><br><span>如果您正在尋找一款以 Minecraft 風格新增槍枝的模組，不妨試試 <strong>Urban Warfare</strong>！<br><br>簡短預告：<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P1X-HbTbxV8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P1X-HbTbxV8</a></span><br><br><span>截至目前，<strong>Urban Warfare</strong> 提供以下功能：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><strong>槍枝</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/708637605671075895/1156895120797483030/image.png?ex=6516a20a&is=6515508a&hm=83d95b6e2762d4d758ff958e8d12895445d0e5c9cd66204e15e70bfc9e3ef340&\" alt=\"KRISS Vector\" width=\"358\" height=\"229\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>KRISS Vector</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/708637605671075895/1156895245942915163/image.png?ex=6516a228&is=651550a8&hm=2a1ca667edde8a53009d73c0a42a1878cd24f63b802d92e76407512e50713bad&\" alt=\"SPAS-12\" width=\"460\" height=\"226\"><br></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>SPAS-12</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><br><br></span></p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/708637605671075895/1156894991575175198/image.png?ex=6516a1ec&is=6515506c&hm=a7dc6fce347a32bdaf894422728ff5bdb27300c602457e1241c34a226b73665d&\" alt=\"Glock 19\" width=\"238\" height=\"232\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>Glock 19<br></span></li>\n<li><span>Barrett M82A1</span></li>\n<li><span>Colt King Python</span></li>\n<li><span>大量配件與新彈藥類型</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>預計功能：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><span>目前暫無！</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><strong>致謝</strong><strong>：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-guns\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Guns</a>（提供範例程式碼）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
